# In dev, Vite proxies /auth, /transactions, etc. to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.js).
# In production (Vercel), point the app at your Render backend. Either:
#   1. Set a rewrite in vercel.json to proxy API paths to the backend, or
#   2. Serve the SPA and backend under the same domain.
# No build-time env var is required for the proxy dev flow.
VITE_API_BASE=
